Z||000000||Hartz||07-05-2001||05:21 PM||||Was doing a little cleaning over the holiday.  Found a bunch of old Fiero literature, magazines, and newsletters.  Anybody remember national club newsletters like "Fiero News" from the "Worldwide Fiero Club" and "Fiero Fever" from the "National Fiero Association?"<P>Fun stuff to look through.<P>They also provided a sober reminder - these clubs failed due to petty infighting and bickering.  Let's not have history repeat itself here on the forum.  Ya'll play nice!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Take care,<BR>Hartz<BR>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo||||reg||7
