Z||000003||Hartz||07-06-2001||04:53 PM||||Galen, <P>OK, these aren't the greatest shots, but here's a couple of more pics of my turbo car:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine_sm.jpg">  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine_compartment_sm.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/interior_sm.jpg">  <P>And no one else remebers these old Fiero clubs and newsletters?  Oh MAN do I feel old now...  :0<P>Hartz<BR>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo<p>[This message has been edited by Hartz (edited 07-06-2001).]||||reg||7
