Z||000006||Rodrv6||07-06-2001||06:57 PM||||Well, I went downstairs and dug out a file folder that has about 14 old issues of the "Worldwide Fiero Club" newsletter "Fiero Secrets".  They range from early 1987 to the middle of 1991 when I ceased to hear anything more from the club.  The fellow who wrote it was Matt Gruber--anyone else hear of him?<BR>I also found some receipts for the famous 84 "fire" recall, I got a new engine for FREE in a car that had 99,600 miles on it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Rod Schneider, Woodstock, Ga.  84 SE, 330,000 miles and counting, 88 GT, not nearly as many miles :)||||reg||10
